                                "sense_id": "0d0e09d0-1eb9-3de8-a8d9-55b34df81ea2",
                                "text": "‘Be assured, if the youth were true, his father who is one of the proudest nobles about the court, would prohibit his union with one so humble and portionless as thou.’"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "30eb79bb-5958-43c4-8124-07a860c23454",
                                "sense_id": "0d0e09d0-1eb9-3de8-a8d9-55b34df81ea2",
                                "text": "‘So my child is portionless,’ resumed the earl, with a suppressed sigh."
                            }
                        ]
